WEBVTT

00:00:12.763 --> 00:00:14.807
[theme music playing]

00:02:17.179 --> 00:02:19.139
[panting]

00:02:20.515 --> 00:02:22.851
[gasping]

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:29.607
[Hundred Eyes]
Stop struggling, fool.

00:02:31.193 --> 00:02:33.236
You were struck by
a five-step snake.

00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:35.572
His venom moves swiftly.

00:02:35.656 --> 00:02:39.242
Most die before their fifth step.

00:02:41.286 --> 00:02:42.705
Where is my sword?

00:02:42.788 --> 00:02:44.039
[Hundred Eyes]
Taken away.

00:02:44.122 --> 00:02:46.499
Punishment for breaking curfew.

00:02:46.583 --> 00:02:49.211
I need to go, Sifu.
Now.

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:52.214
How do you revenge a snake?

00:02:53.048 --> 00:02:57.135
You would be a fool to think
only one serpent lays in wait.

00:02:57.219 --> 00:03:00.472
There is always
a deadlier strike to come.

00:03:00.555 --> 00:03:02.766
One should walk away.

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:03.934
[Jingim]
Sifu.

00:03:05.518 --> 00:03:06.519
Master Polo.

00:03:09.439 --> 00:03:11.608
Save your breath.

00:03:12.567 --> 00:03:16.571
The Khan requests
that I inquire as to the Latin's health.

00:03:16.654 --> 00:03:18.531
Will he survive?

00:03:20.784 --> 00:03:23.120
Father will be most pleased.

00:03:23.203 --> 00:03:25.080
[Hundred Eyes]
And, um, the Prince?

00:03:27.624 --> 00:03:29.542
Without compassion,

00:03:29.626 --> 00:03:32.337
what is there
to distinguish men from beasts?

00:03:33.671 --> 00:03:35.841
What was your student
doing beyond the walls?

00:03:35.924 --> 00:03:37.592
[Marco]
Sleep escaped me.

00:03:37.675 --> 00:03:40.553
I thought a ride would clear my mind.

00:03:46.559 --> 00:03:49.396
So close to your throat...

00:03:50.647 --> 00:03:54.442
A few inches lower,
the venom would have stilled your heart.

00:03:54.526 --> 00:03:57.988
Tread carefully, Master Polo.

00:03:58.071 --> 00:04:01.574
Or you will find yourself
a more permanent sleep.

00:04:12.335 --> 00:04:14.254
[Kublai moaning]

00:04:40.697 --> 00:04:41.865
Great Khan.

00:04:42.825 --> 00:04:45.327
Business forces us
to disturb you.

00:04:49.747 --> 00:04:51.124
Escort the concubine out.

00:04:51.208 --> 00:04:53.335
Leave her to her task.

00:04:54.211 --> 00:04:55.628
[moaning continues]

00:04:58.631 --> 00:05:02.010
Tell me, son,
what news of the Latin?

00:05:02.094 --> 00:05:05.055
Would you rather not hear
the news we carry of the Song rebels?

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:11.061
I would have asked first if I had.

00:05:16.441 --> 00:05:20.737
The foreigner claims his mind was
muddied with thoughts that hindered sleep.

00:05:20.821 --> 00:05:23.781
He hoped a ride in the grasslands
might assist him.

00:05:23.866 --> 00:05:24.867
Oh.

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:28.161
I wonder what disturbed him so.

00:05:28.245 --> 00:05:30.247
The healer promised
a full recovery.

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:32.665
What news of the Song?

00:05:33.625 --> 00:05:35.002
They request a parley.

00:05:35.919 --> 00:05:37.545
To what end,
we do not know.

00:05:37.629 --> 00:05:40.840
[Jingim]
It seems an auspicious opportunity.

00:05:40.924 --> 00:05:42.342
They are afraid of war.

00:05:42.425 --> 00:05:43.593
An opportunity born of what, though?

00:05:43.676 --> 00:05:45.595
It makes little sense
with their current standing.

00:05:45.678 --> 00:05:47.222
But the parley will give us clarity.

00:05:48.515 --> 00:05:50.225
They request you personally, Sire.

00:05:50.308 --> 00:05:52.978
Perhaps a ruse to take your life.

00:05:53.061 --> 00:05:56.648
We must not be deceived.
Prepare to destroy them.

00:05:57.774 --> 00:06:00.402
They will make do with emissaries.

00:06:00.485 --> 00:06:02.862
The thought of a parley pleases me.

00:06:02.946 --> 00:06:05.073
Jingim's instincts are correct.

00:06:05.157 --> 00:06:07.075
Assemble the War Council.

00:06:15.875 --> 00:06:17.419
[moaning contentedly]

00:06:25.635 --> 00:06:26.886
[Ling Ling laughing]

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:29.097
[Jia Sidao] She has quite a way
with the boy, doesn't she?

00:06:29.181 --> 00:06:31.141
Caring. Kind.

00:06:31.224 --> 00:06:33.310
She is her mother's daughter.

00:06:35.187 --> 00:06:37.147
Will my mother
come back for me, Uncle?

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:38.773
Of course.

00:06:38.856 --> 00:06:43.861
She is simply off learning
to be the best dancer in the world

00:06:43.946 --> 00:06:46.323
-so she can teach you one day.
-Mmm-hmm.

00:06:47.324 --> 00:06:49.117
Then I will be the best dancer

00:06:49.201 --> 00:06:50.285
-in the world.
-Mmm-hmm.

00:06:50.368 --> 00:06:52.245
'Tis odd...

00:06:52.329 --> 00:06:56.333
I've not seen Mei Lin since
the Emperor's spirit left his body.

00:06:56.416 --> 00:06:58.793
Where does your sister
keep herself now?

00:06:59.877 --> 00:07:01.713
Returned to her old ways, I suspect.

00:07:01.796 --> 00:07:04.382
Practicing her art in brothels.

00:07:04.466 --> 00:07:07.385
Mei Lin was cared for
and welcomed in her time here.

00:07:08.636 --> 00:07:10.805
What would drive her away?

00:07:10.888 --> 00:07:12.182
Treasure?

00:07:12.265 --> 00:07:14.642
You have enough to share, surely.

00:07:14.726 --> 00:07:16.603
I am not my sister's protector.

00:07:16.686 --> 00:07:17.812
[Empress Dowager]
Why?

00:07:17.895 --> 00:07:20.648
Was she not yours
in the days before your ascension?

00:07:20.732 --> 00:07:24.152
-That was a long time ago, Empress.
-[Ling Ling laughing]

00:07:28.698 --> 00:07:31.618
Would such a look have escaped
your face toward my husband?

00:07:32.744 --> 00:07:34.662
[Jia Sidao] I never knew
your husband to eat jonquils.

00:07:34.746 --> 00:07:37.415
If it suited him, he would have.

00:07:37.499 --> 00:07:40.210
And you would have worn
a more esteemed look.

00:07:40.293 --> 00:07:42.045
I am the Emperor!

00:07:42.129 --> 00:07:43.921
[Jia Sidao]
If my Emperor could eat flowers

00:07:44.006 --> 00:07:46.091
and keep the Mongols in check...

00:07:47.259 --> 00:07:49.677
I would gladly serve him a garden.

00:08:06.403 --> 00:08:07.529
[Marco]
Let me pass.

00:08:07.612 --> 00:08:08.863
[guard] What's your business, foreigner?

00:08:08.946 --> 00:08:10.073
[Marco] Let me pass!

00:08:10.157 --> 00:08:12.242
-[guard] What's your business--
-[Za Bing] Leave him.

00:08:16.746 --> 00:08:18.748
I need to speak with Kokachin.

00:08:19.916 --> 00:08:23.503
Delusion is an imperfection
that defiles the mind.

00:08:23.586 --> 00:08:25.463
I must speak with her, please.

00:08:33.138 --> 00:08:36.141
Is it the serpent's sting
that has deluded you?

00:08:36.224 --> 00:08:37.725
I intend no harm.

00:08:37.809 --> 00:08:39.186
[scoffs]

00:08:39.269 --> 00:08:41.396
You are incapable of harm,
Master Marco.

00:08:41.479 --> 00:08:44.774
You need to be more vigilant
in your protection of Kokachin.

00:08:44.857 --> 00:08:45.983
She is in danger.

00:08:46.068 --> 00:08:48.611
Concern yourself
with the danger you face.

00:08:48.695 --> 00:08:51.823
The Blue Princess
is secure in my care.

00:08:51.906 --> 00:08:54.909
Leave now
or suffer my fate.

00:08:55.993 --> 00:08:57.204
[sighs]

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:01.041
[relieved groan]

00:09:01.124 --> 00:09:03.000
[Za Bing urinating]

00:09:04.086 --> 00:09:07.214
Have you ever sampled
the third sex, Latin?

00:09:10.633 --> 00:09:12.635
[urinating continues]

00:09:13.928 --> 00:09:14.929
[sighs]

00:09:24.772 --> 00:09:28.360
Four winters ago, I took an arrow
in the back fighting the North Hordes.

00:09:28.443 --> 00:09:31.363
I tasted blood for two days.

00:09:31.446 --> 00:09:36.409
Great Khan bid me come and see him
when I was finally able to stand.

00:09:36.493 --> 00:09:39.621
And I'm his own flesh and blood.

00:09:46.419 --> 00:09:48.130
You were strong

00:09:48.213 --> 00:09:50.965
and quickly saddled
your own steed again.

00:09:52.342 --> 00:09:54.302
So brave.

00:10:05.688 --> 00:10:08.150
I heard word of a parley
with the Song rebels.

00:10:08.233 --> 00:10:11.027
-Is it true?
-It is.

00:10:11.111 --> 00:10:13.196
The War Council assembles.

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:14.947
In your absence?

00:10:15.031 --> 00:10:16.699
We wait on Father.

00:10:16.783 --> 00:10:18.118
Where is he?

00:10:19.286 --> 00:10:22.789
Surely tending to
his round-eyed pet.

00:10:22.872 --> 00:10:26.209
Might you offer your Empress tea?
Or will you continue to stand idle?

00:10:26.293 --> 00:10:28.211
Forgive me, Empress.

00:10:39.847 --> 00:10:41.849
Spare the Europa no thought, Jingim.

00:10:42.809 --> 00:10:46.188
Do not let your father
doubt you the better man.

00:10:46.271 --> 00:10:48.398
I am the better man.

00:10:48.481 --> 00:10:52.944
The better man does not sit in the dark
with his woman and his jealousies.

00:10:53.027 --> 00:10:56.781
The better man stands erect and strong

00:10:56.864 --> 00:11:00.618
and finds a way
to tilt the scales in his favor.

00:11:06.082 --> 00:11:08.251
-[horse whinnying]
-[Sube] Easy, girl.

00:11:14.716 --> 00:11:15.717
Sube.

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:18.511
A message for my brother.

00:11:19.554 --> 00:11:20.930
It's urgent.

00:11:21.013 --> 00:11:24.226
Follow our arrangement
and make fast your horse.

00:11:25.310 --> 00:11:26.394
Yes, ma'am.

00:11:27.562 --> 00:11:30.273
[Ahmad] Sidao beheaded
our men not weeks ago.

00:11:30.357 --> 00:11:31.941
Why call for peace now?

00:11:32.024 --> 00:11:34.736
[Jingim] He fears the wrath
that comes and seeks to alter course.

00:11:34.819 --> 00:11:38.365
The man is not circumspect.
Jia Sidao is too arrogant for that.

00:11:38.448 --> 00:11:40.325
[Yusuf] His ambition
is his arrogance.

00:11:40.408 --> 00:11:44.496
But the Chancellor is not the only
mind at work within the Walled City.

00:11:44.579 --> 00:11:46.789
You see a different landscape, Yusuf?

00:11:46.873 --> 00:11:49.584
Have your spies received
intelligence from Xiangyang?

00:11:49.667 --> 00:11:52.337
No, Sire.
I rely now on my own.

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:55.214
The Boy Emperor
is but five seasons old.

00:11:55.298 --> 00:11:57.592
His coronation day approaches.

00:11:57.675 --> 00:12:01.220
Sidao may play the royal,
but he's a pretender to the throne.

00:12:01.304 --> 00:12:05.350
He desires power, but holds
no royal position or blood claim.

00:12:05.433 --> 00:12:07.727
There are other ways to secure power,
Prince Jingim.

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:12.064
Are we safe to assume
Jia Sidao takes such steps presently?

00:12:12.148 --> 00:12:13.316
[Jingim] Yes.

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:15.485
A divided empire
is an opportunity.

00:12:15.568 --> 00:12:18.405
One that must be seized upon
with ruthless force.

00:12:18.488 --> 00:12:20.990
One that can be
molded to serve us.

00:12:21.073 --> 00:12:23.159
[Kublai] Sidao is a peasant...

00:12:23.242 --> 00:12:25.328
Empress a grieving widow.

00:12:25.412 --> 00:12:29.123
A grieving widow
loyal to the memory of her husband.

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:33.252
The dead Emperor
was always a reluctant warrior.

00:12:33.336 --> 00:12:34.379
[grunts]

00:12:42.094 --> 00:12:44.263
Which hand offers the parley?

00:12:46.349 --> 00:12:47.767
Either way,

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:50.186
it is better to
know what we face...

00:12:50.269 --> 00:12:52.480
and win the war
with this knowledge

00:12:52.564 --> 00:12:54.857
before we consider the battlefield.

00:13:00.112 --> 00:13:01.280
We parley.

00:13:01.364 --> 00:13:03.783
See what the table presents us.

00:13:04.326 --> 00:13:07.203
Perhaps there will be
a dung-stuffed head of a five-year-old.

00:13:07.286 --> 00:13:09.747
Then we will have our answer.

00:13:09.831 --> 00:13:10.998
Ahmad...

00:13:12.875 --> 00:13:15.712
you will lead the parley
with the Song ambassadors.

00:13:15.795 --> 00:13:17.254
Depart at dawn.

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:19.382
Sire...

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:24.721
might I recommend
sending Prince Jingim...

00:13:25.638 --> 00:13:29.308
so the parley has some
semblance of royal command?

00:13:32.979 --> 00:13:34.522
Prince Jingim will
oversee the conference.

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:39.110
You honor me
with this task.

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:43.781
[grunts]

00:13:54.125 --> 00:13:57.294
Heal the battle wounds
of Wuchang, Jingim...

00:13:57.379 --> 00:13:59.464
as a diplomat making peace.

00:14:10.016 --> 00:14:11.308
[Marco grunts]

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:15.229
Never volunteer
for a stealth mission.

00:14:15.312 --> 00:14:17.857
You might as well
have a barking dog accompany you.

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:20.652
-I need my sword.
-Are all Latins as dense as you?

00:14:24.989 --> 00:14:26.949
I would give you a sword...

00:14:27.033 --> 00:14:29.035
but I'm afraid whose body
the blade would find

00:14:29.118 --> 00:14:30.953
when the rumors reach you.

00:14:32.121 --> 00:14:34.416
Your father has returned.

00:14:37.794 --> 00:14:39.421
[ostrich honking]

00:14:44.426 --> 00:14:45.718
[Niccolò] Great Khan,

00:14:45.802 --> 00:14:50.181
a rare and exotic gift
from the Arabian Peninsula

00:14:50.264 --> 00:14:52.058
by route of Dunhuang.

00:14:52.141 --> 00:14:54.686
[Kublai]
Animal smells of shit.

00:14:57.397 --> 00:15:00.692
It has been aboard our caravan
for weeks, Great Khan.

00:15:00.775 --> 00:15:01.818
Rise.

00:15:01.901 --> 00:15:05.321
A caravan we humbly
take through your kingdom.

00:15:05.405 --> 00:15:08.908
A kindness we wish to continue,
if your wisdom should allow us.

00:15:08.991 --> 00:15:12.244
Prosperous business
is always welcome.

00:15:12.328 --> 00:15:15.457
We gladly gave tribute,
Lord Khan.

00:15:17.625 --> 00:15:19.836
You shall be allowed
to continue your trade.

00:15:19.919 --> 00:15:22.422
My realm is yours.

00:15:29.846 --> 00:15:32.807
Do you have
any interest in your son?

00:15:34.476 --> 00:15:36.686
Yes, Sire.
I am anxious to embrace him.

00:15:36.769 --> 00:15:38.771
It has been too long.

00:15:38.855 --> 00:15:42.358
Then turn, merchant, and behold.

00:16:14.431 --> 00:16:15.892
You look like an Oriental.

00:16:15.975 --> 00:16:18.811
[Niccolò]
One must adapt to survive, brother.

00:16:18.895 --> 00:16:20.104
And Marco has.

00:16:20.187 --> 00:16:22.649
One can adapt
without forsaking his heritage...

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:25.151
his father's heritage.

00:16:25.234 --> 00:16:26.986
My father forsook his son.

00:16:27.069 --> 00:16:29.697
-I understand your--
-You understand nothing!

00:16:31.365 --> 00:16:33.576
I am sorry I had to leave you,

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:35.077
but it is more dangerous
on the Silk Road--

00:16:35.161 --> 00:16:37.038
Why did you return?

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:42.001
To bank profits, pay tribute,
mostly to see my boy.

00:16:42.084 --> 00:16:44.170
Is that not enough?

00:16:44.253 --> 00:16:46.338
It is enough.

00:16:46.422 --> 00:16:47.590
It's not believable.

00:16:47.674 --> 00:16:50.051
There are reasons
why we left you.

00:16:52.595 --> 00:16:54.889
Reasons we must again
return to the Silk Road.

00:16:54.972 --> 00:16:56.558
-Commerce.
-No.

00:16:57.517 --> 00:16:59.769
You must trust me when I say

00:16:59.852 --> 00:17:05.232
all efforts that I make are for
our home... our Lord and for you.

00:17:07.193 --> 00:17:08.861
I need your help.

00:17:08.945 --> 00:17:10.362
Say it and it is done.

00:17:10.446 --> 00:17:11.614
Give me your blade.

00:17:11.698 --> 00:17:13.365
[Niccolò] For what purpose?

00:17:13.449 --> 00:17:15.952
This was not an accident.

00:17:16.035 --> 00:17:18.079
-What trouble have you got into?
-It is no concern of yours.

00:17:18.162 --> 00:17:20.790
What requires a sword, Marco?

00:17:21.708 --> 00:17:24.168
Someone is in danger.

00:17:24.251 --> 00:17:26.420
-Someone?
-A friend.

00:17:26.503 --> 00:17:28.631
A woman?

00:17:31.342 --> 00:17:33.052
Marco, listen to me.

00:17:33.135 --> 00:17:37.014
Despite your dress and visage,
you are not one of them.

00:17:37.098 --> 00:17:38.891
You never will be.

00:17:38.975 --> 00:17:41.227
You get involved with them,
you damage us.

00:17:41.310 --> 00:17:43.520
You damage the family business.

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:50.236
I thought he would never go.

00:17:53.072 --> 00:17:54.907
One day, he will understand.

00:18:43.164 --> 00:18:44.957
Your chest is puffed.

00:18:46.208 --> 00:18:47.334
In this place,

00:18:47.418 --> 00:18:49.712
that's what whores do
when they want to get fucked.

00:18:49.796 --> 00:18:53.758
The horseman with the shaved head,
where is he?

00:18:53.841 --> 00:18:55.592
That's half of Cambulac.

00:18:55.677 --> 00:18:59.806
This one deals in jewels
he could not rightfully own.

00:18:59.889 --> 00:19:02.016
That's the other half of Cambulac.

00:19:03.392 --> 00:19:04.644
Now, piss off.

00:19:04.727 --> 00:19:06.688
You know who I speak of.

00:19:08.564 --> 00:19:10.858
Tell me where I can find him.

00:19:20.576 --> 00:19:23.830
Did you enter
my tea house unarmed?

00:19:27.541 --> 00:19:28.584
Answer me!

00:19:28.668 --> 00:19:29.669
[grunting]

00:19:40.096 --> 00:19:41.097
[gasping]

00:19:46.268 --> 00:19:47.311
[groans]

00:19:51.482 --> 00:19:52.649
Tell me where!

00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:56.070
The south end.

00:19:56.153 --> 00:19:58.906
The shanty by the ironworks.

00:19:58.990 --> 00:20:01.868
If you're lying,
I will come back.

00:20:02.869 --> 00:20:04.370
Please do. [grunts]

00:20:07.081 --> 00:20:08.499
[Altan gasping]

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:18.444
[faint scratching sound]

00:21:34.210 --> 00:21:36.420
[scratching continues]

00:21:52.854 --> 00:21:55.857
[scratching continues]

00:22:34.228 --> 00:22:35.687
[grunting]

00:22:36.898 --> 00:22:38.524
Why do you threaten Kokachin?

00:22:38.607 --> 00:22:39.691
[grunts]

00:22:41.235 --> 00:22:44.488
I saw you on the grasslands.
I saw you take the jewels.

00:22:44.571 --> 00:22:46.949
What concern is it of yours?

00:22:48.409 --> 00:22:49.410
[grunts]

00:22:50.411 --> 00:22:53.789
I threatened Kokachin with nothing!
You pursued me.

00:22:53.872 --> 00:22:57.084
I thought you the danger.
I would lay down my life for her.

00:22:57.751 --> 00:22:59.628
[men shouting]

00:23:02.214 --> 00:23:04.591
[Marco]
What are you doing? No!

00:23:05.927 --> 00:23:09.346
Let me go!
Let me go! Now!

00:23:09.430 --> 00:23:10.806
-Let me go!
-[guard] No!

00:23:12.058 --> 00:23:13.935
[Marco]
You're making a mistake.

00:23:23.027 --> 00:23:26.322
Tell Vice Regent Yusuf where I am.
He will tell you.

00:23:27.531 --> 00:23:29.241
It's on his orders.

00:23:31.577 --> 00:23:32.578
[cell locks]

00:23:38.167 --> 00:23:39.710
You did this.

00:23:40.836 --> 00:23:42.046
No.

00:23:43.672 --> 00:23:45.674
Those savages did this,

00:23:45.757 --> 00:23:47.134
though we did nothing.

00:23:47.218 --> 00:23:49.011
Those dogs you live with,

00:23:49.095 --> 00:23:51.973
they don't know
how to treat men of God.

00:23:52.056 --> 00:23:53.432
-We were--
-[Niccolò] Smuggling.

00:23:55.434 --> 00:23:56.978
We were smuggling.

00:23:58.980 --> 00:24:01.607
There is no point
lying to the boy.

00:24:10.782 --> 00:24:12.743
Do you know
what they do for that?

00:24:17.581 --> 00:24:19.708
Why am I here?

00:24:21.543 --> 00:24:24.130
We had to store
the goods somewhere.

00:24:24.213 --> 00:24:25.339
The coin, son.

00:24:26.423 --> 00:24:28.717
You left me
in this foreign land...

00:24:31.262 --> 00:24:33.305
and now you have destroyed me.

00:24:35.224 --> 00:24:37.559
Do you not see that?

00:24:41.730 --> 00:24:43.357
You're a coward.

00:24:59.540 --> 00:25:00.749
All my life

00:25:00.832 --> 00:25:05.962
I have waited for the great adventurer
to offer me a place at his side.

00:25:09.716 --> 00:25:12.219
I finally got what I wanted.

00:26:11.987 --> 00:26:13.405
Sidao is not here?

00:26:13.489 --> 00:26:16.367
With regret, no.

00:26:16.450 --> 00:26:20.246
Surely, the same regret
the Great Khan offers

00:26:20.329 --> 00:26:21.872
for not attending.

00:26:23.415 --> 00:26:27.419
I am his son and heir
and I speak with full authority.

00:26:27.503 --> 00:26:31.798
And I, Prince,
speak with authority from the Walled City.

00:26:31.882 --> 00:26:33.592
And from whose authority
does that flow?

00:26:33.675 --> 00:26:36.762
The child, the old woman,
or the pretender?

00:26:38.180 --> 00:26:41.808
I speak on behalf of
all the Song dynasty.

00:26:41.892 --> 00:26:43.310
[Ahmad] You mean
all that remains

00:26:43.394 --> 00:26:45.771
by a shred of silk
down by the Han River.

00:26:45.854 --> 00:26:48.774
We take your request
for parley with seriousness.

00:26:48.857 --> 00:26:50.859
As a gesture of such,

00:26:50.942 --> 00:26:55.572
the Great Khan releases
our prisoners of war from Wuchang to you.

00:26:55.656 --> 00:26:58.492
Your gesture is greatly appreciated.

00:26:58.575 --> 00:26:59.826
So was yours.

00:26:59.910 --> 00:27:02.746
Though returning our prisoners
without their bodies

00:27:02.829 --> 00:27:05.040
was an interesting prelude for peace.

00:27:05.123 --> 00:27:08.752
A regrettable circumstance of war

00:27:08.835 --> 00:27:11.297
and one we wish not to repeat.

00:27:11.380 --> 00:27:12.673
We are in agreement.

00:27:12.756 --> 00:27:15.967
And my father's minister will capitulate.

00:27:16.051 --> 00:27:18.094
Of course.

00:27:18.179 --> 00:27:21.432
Provided suitable terms
and tribute payments are offered.

00:27:23.099 --> 00:27:24.185
We are prepared to offer--

00:27:24.268 --> 00:27:27.062
Five hundred thousand
taels of silver.

00:27:27.145 --> 00:27:29.648
Five hundred thousand
bolts of silk.

00:27:29.731 --> 00:27:32.984
And three of every
five grains of rice you sow...

00:27:33.068 --> 00:27:34.361
for 10 years.

00:27:35.737 --> 00:27:39.658
This is beyond reason.
We called for this parley in good faith.

00:27:39.741 --> 00:27:42.286
You called for this parley in fear.

00:27:42.953 --> 00:27:46.039
If you do not wish to
engage in honorable terms,

00:27:46.122 --> 00:27:47.874
-we will return to--
-[Jingim] Ambassador,

00:27:47.958 --> 00:27:49.543
this rate is unwarranted.

00:27:50.586 --> 00:27:52.671
We will find a suitable figure.

00:27:52.754 --> 00:27:56.842
And Minister Ahmad will wait
with the convoy by the horses.

00:28:13.942 --> 00:28:18.989
The Great Kublai Khan
is interested in peace with South China.

00:28:19.072 --> 00:28:23.452
All he demands is that your leaders
surrender the Song dynasty to history.

00:28:23.535 --> 00:28:28.499
Become unified with the North
in a new dynasty under a new emperor.

00:28:29.250 --> 00:28:32.586
This message
is a burden of royalty.

00:28:34.087 --> 00:28:37.048
One better suited to myself
than the Minister.

00:28:37.132 --> 00:28:42.721
Your respect for Chinese ways and culture
is known to us, Prince.

00:29:20.884 --> 00:29:22.761
We are still new to
the ways of your kingdom.

00:29:26.723 --> 00:29:29.518
Value is the first thing you seek.

00:29:30.477 --> 00:29:31.812
Risk, the second.

00:29:33.439 --> 00:29:35.274
The silk worm is sacred,

00:29:35.357 --> 00:29:38.444
more valuable
than gems and gold, Master Polo.

00:29:38.527 --> 00:29:42.573
Its theft is punishable by death.

00:29:42.656 --> 00:29:46.493
Please... we did not know--

00:29:46.577 --> 00:29:47.953
Enough.

00:30:03.677 --> 00:30:05.387
What is their origin?

00:30:05.471 --> 00:30:07.138
They were not procured by us.

00:30:09.891 --> 00:30:12.728
A man in our caravan
acquired them.

00:30:18.692 --> 00:30:20.235
Where is this man now?

00:30:20.319 --> 00:30:22.904
He did not survive the journey,
Lord Khan.

00:30:30.704 --> 00:30:32.956
And I'm quite confident
neither shall you.

00:31:15.331 --> 00:31:19.378
A dispatch has arrived, Chancellor.
From your sister.

00:32:01.169 --> 00:32:03.505
I've just received word that
the great and noble Kublai Khan

00:32:03.589 --> 00:32:06.257
will not be attending
my peace parley.

00:32:07.426 --> 00:32:10.095
What parley?

00:32:11.262 --> 00:32:13.389
What have you done?

00:32:15.141 --> 00:32:17.519
You no longer hold a place
in the Royal Court.

00:32:19.563 --> 00:32:21.022
Old woman,

00:32:21.106 --> 00:32:24.568
you have no authority
to dictate or declare my place.

00:32:26.152 --> 00:32:30.365
My ambassadors were instructed to secure
an accord with the Mongols at all costs.

00:32:30.449 --> 00:32:32.909
When they return,
I will have every authority

00:32:32.993 --> 00:32:35.286
and you will find yourself
a lonely warmonger.

00:32:36.412 --> 00:32:39.374
Your currency is the fear of war.

00:32:39.458 --> 00:32:42.168
But it is spent
and you are nothing without it.

00:32:43.086 --> 00:32:46.590
The Song shall not share rice
with that bloated Mongolian cur.

00:32:46.673 --> 00:32:49.968
The Council will
embrace peace if offered.

00:32:51.136 --> 00:32:55.306
The people of South China
will do their Lord's bidding.

00:32:55.390 --> 00:32:57.392
And so will you.

00:33:13.366 --> 00:33:15.661
[chains rattling]

00:33:34.846 --> 00:33:36.056
Unchain him.

00:33:44.856 --> 00:33:46.399
Leave us.

00:33:58.787 --> 00:34:00.496
Tell me of your father.

00:34:10.716 --> 00:34:12.258
He...

00:34:15.011 --> 00:34:17.097
He is a well-regarded trader.

00:34:19.307 --> 00:34:21.685
His shipping contacts
have remained loyal through the years.

00:34:21.768 --> 00:34:25.355
I ask of character
and you tell me of his profession.

00:34:25.438 --> 00:34:29.901
Do you have any of your colorful language
that speaks to the man or not?

00:34:31.277 --> 00:34:34.280
It would be artful color, My Lord.

00:34:36.324 --> 00:34:38.201
A mirage.

00:34:43.498 --> 00:34:46.960
[Kublai] I grew hearing tales
of the Great Genghis.

00:34:48.587 --> 00:34:50.421
I knew him only as a small boy,

00:34:50.505 --> 00:34:54.384
but the man my eyes saw
was not big enough.

00:34:55.844 --> 00:34:58.639
Genghis of my mind...

00:34:58.722 --> 00:35:01.307
he was a giant.

00:35:02.684 --> 00:35:05.395
Our imaginations outrun us, Sire.

00:35:10.483 --> 00:35:13.612
When you made your way to Cambulac
and your father left you to me,

00:35:13.695 --> 00:35:16.281
you had gone no further east,
had you?

00:35:17.783 --> 00:35:18.909
No.

00:35:21.536 --> 00:35:23.664
These silkworms...

00:35:25.290 --> 00:35:27.583
they are native
to the Jiangxi province.

00:35:27.668 --> 00:35:31.171
A region you have never visited.

00:35:31.254 --> 00:35:34.257
But your father and uncle
have since traveled there.

00:35:38.428 --> 00:35:42.223
It's the cocoon
that gives the silk.

00:35:43.850 --> 00:35:46.687
Comes out like sweet milk, then hardens.

00:35:48.939 --> 00:35:52.150
Ugly worm turns
into an ugly moth, but...

00:35:53.609 --> 00:35:55.320
leaves such treasure behind.

00:35:56.738 --> 00:36:00.450
Then some child somewhere
crushes the moth, but...

00:36:01.827 --> 00:36:03.954
the silk is still mine.

00:36:05.747 --> 00:36:07.082
The worm...

00:36:09.334 --> 00:36:11.044
the silk...

00:36:11.127 --> 00:36:13.296
the child...

00:36:14.547 --> 00:36:15.841
All mine.

00:36:22.347 --> 00:36:25.641
You will be spared.

00:36:28.103 --> 00:36:30.772
Your father and uncle
will be sentenced.

00:36:31.815 --> 00:36:34.985
Artful color will not
alter their character.

00:36:35.902 --> 00:36:38.488
What is their punishment?

00:36:39.948 --> 00:36:42.533
It is on this that I dwell.

00:37:08.226 --> 00:37:09.644
[knock on door]

00:37:10.812 --> 00:37:12.022
[knocking continues]

00:37:28.621 --> 00:37:30.706
You've been fighting.

00:37:30.791 --> 00:37:33.584
A spy, he tracked me.

00:37:35.336 --> 00:37:37.088
Who was it?

00:37:37.172 --> 00:37:39.090
A foreigner.
A round eye.

00:37:40.675 --> 00:37:41.802
He is no threat.

00:37:41.885 --> 00:37:43.594
The Imperial Guard arrested him.

00:37:43.678 --> 00:37:45.305
You did not need
to set the snake.

00:37:49.017 --> 00:37:50.601
If the Guard have him--

00:37:50.685 --> 00:37:52.020
He knows nothing.

00:37:52.103 --> 00:37:54.022
He thought I was trying to hurt you,

00:37:54.105 --> 00:37:56.149
to steal from you.

00:38:01.071 --> 00:38:02.948
And he tried to defend me.

00:38:03.031 --> 00:38:04.157
Why would he do that?

00:38:05.826 --> 00:38:07.953
I do not know.

00:38:08.036 --> 00:38:11.998
But I know your mind.
I turn my heart to no other.

00:38:13.416 --> 00:38:16.669
The gems have traded well.
We should go.

00:38:16.752 --> 00:38:18.088
Patience.

00:38:18.171 --> 00:38:19.965
War is coming.

00:38:20.048 --> 00:38:23.051
We will find cover
for our escape within it.

00:38:39.109 --> 00:38:41.444
The Song have agreed
to cease their raids in the west

00:38:41.527 --> 00:38:43.446
and pay tribute to you, Father.

00:38:44.780 --> 00:38:47.200
Peace without bloodshed
is upon us.

00:38:47.283 --> 00:38:49.995
Was there a sense of where
the parley offer came from?

00:38:50.078 --> 00:38:51.787
Who is the administering hand?

00:38:51.872 --> 00:38:54.790
[Jingim] To this end,
the Minister was wise to inquire.

00:38:54.875 --> 00:38:57.168
They artfully evaded a direct answer.

00:38:57.252 --> 00:39:00.380
But it would be safe
to assume the Walled City is caught

00:39:00.463 --> 00:39:03.174
amidst a power struggle
between the Chancellor Jia Sidao

00:39:03.258 --> 00:39:04.634
and the Empress Dowager.

00:39:05.801 --> 00:39:08.554
Let the yellow birds
battle over their defeat

00:39:08.638 --> 00:39:13.101
while we celebrate
the well-crafted victory of Prince Jingim.

00:39:13.184 --> 00:39:14.602
-Yes.
-[court murmurs in agreement]

00:39:19.315 --> 00:39:21.192
[Chabi] Such an ugly little creature.

00:39:21.276 --> 00:39:23.694
[Kublai] Yet men will kill for it.

00:39:24.946 --> 00:39:26.990
Risk my wrath.

00:39:27.073 --> 00:39:28.574
Betray their blood.

00:39:29.659 --> 00:39:31.452
Because to them...

00:39:33.079 --> 00:39:36.332
it is fortune, not legacy,
that changes a life.

00:39:45.175 --> 00:39:46.676
[growls softly]

00:39:48.094 --> 00:39:49.720
Come to me.

00:39:52.598 --> 00:39:53.849
[clears throat]

00:39:56.269 --> 00:39:57.270
[grunts]

00:40:07.405 --> 00:40:09.407
What is wrong?

00:40:09.490 --> 00:40:11.284
I'm simply surprised.

00:40:12.577 --> 00:40:13.954
By?

00:40:15.205 --> 00:40:18.624
Your attention these days
seems to be occupied with...

00:40:18.708 --> 00:40:20.335
Chinese matters.

00:40:21.544 --> 00:40:22.545
Ah.

00:40:23.504 --> 00:40:24.547
Yes.

00:40:25.798 --> 00:40:28.676
These Chinese, they...

00:40:28.759 --> 00:40:30.720
require careful attention.

00:40:31.972 --> 00:40:35.058
Well, I should...
have to watch her close.

00:40:38.394 --> 00:40:41.856
Not something the Great Khan
should be troubled with.

00:40:44.359 --> 00:40:46.902
Let me find you
someone more exotic.

00:40:48.529 --> 00:40:50.740
An Indian.

00:40:50.823 --> 00:40:52.658
A Zanzibari.

00:40:52.742 --> 00:40:55.245
Perhaps, a Slav.

00:40:55.328 --> 00:40:57.038
It's her...

00:40:57.122 --> 00:41:02.627
Her prowess is evident,
yet simply not harnessed in the...

00:41:02.710 --> 00:41:04.087
proper manner.

00:41:05.421 --> 00:41:09.092
Something that should be
remedied with much practice.

00:41:14.639 --> 00:41:18.851
You worry without cause,
my lovely, favorite wife.

00:41:20.228 --> 00:41:23.231
You have a place
above all others.

00:41:24.524 --> 00:41:25.858
Ceremonially.

00:41:27.235 --> 00:41:28.736
Chabi...

00:41:30.321 --> 00:41:31.822
you have my devotion.

00:41:48.256 --> 00:41:52.343
It is time to honor
Jingim's Mongol triumph over the Chinese.

00:42:19.912 --> 00:42:22.582
Your mother sent a message today.

00:42:22.665 --> 00:42:26.044
An important message
that arrived too late.

00:42:26.127 --> 00:42:27.503
It cost me greatly.

00:42:29.130 --> 00:42:31.507
But luck was with me.

00:42:31.591 --> 00:42:34.135
I turned your mother's failure
to my favor.

00:42:35.345 --> 00:42:38.806
Still, mistakes demand correction.

00:42:41.142 --> 00:42:44.145
I have a tale to tell you
before sleep.

00:42:46.106 --> 00:42:48.191
[theater music playing]

00:42:50.610 --> 00:42:51.777
[Kublai chuckling]

00:42:53.113 --> 00:42:56.699
It's the Cricket Minister.
[laughing] It's the Cricket Minister.

00:42:56.782 --> 00:43:00.578
Look how they leap. [laughing]
Look how they leap.

00:43:00.661 --> 00:43:03.664
[man singing in Cantonese]

00:43:05.125 --> 00:43:08.669
[singing continues]

00:43:10.588 --> 00:43:11.589
[court laughing]

00:43:15.426 --> 00:43:18.096
A victorious son!

00:43:18.179 --> 00:43:19.389
[Kublai chuckling]

00:43:22.142 --> 00:43:23.601
[Kublai] Ahmad!

00:43:31.066 --> 00:43:32.652
[Jia Sidao] <i>Long ago...</i>

00:43:32.735 --> 00:43:36.114
the consort Yao Niang
was the favorite of Emperor Li Yu.

00:43:36.197 --> 00:43:39.367
She was a dancer, like you.

00:43:40.618 --> 00:43:41.827
Emperor Yu believed

00:43:41.911 --> 00:43:45.748
that a woman's feet were
the very essence of feminine beauty.

00:43:46.707 --> 00:43:48.918
This is why
he liked Yao Niang.

00:43:49.001 --> 00:43:53.298
Her feet were small,
delicate, perfect.

00:43:54.507 --> 00:43:57.593
Women with such feet
became coveted.

00:43:57.677 --> 00:44:01.556
Measures had to be taken
to keep their feet the perfect size.

00:44:01.639 --> 00:44:03.308
Three inches long.

00:44:03.391 --> 00:44:04.392
[giggles]

00:44:07.437 --> 00:44:10.105
They had to be bound.

00:44:13.276 --> 00:44:15.945
That is not
how that happened.

00:44:16.028 --> 00:44:19.365
I congratulate you, brother,
on a fine accord.

00:44:19.449 --> 00:44:22.993
You are now proven
in battle and politics.

00:44:23.077 --> 00:44:24.829
Warrior and diplomat.

00:44:24.912 --> 00:44:26.872
[man singing in Cantonese]

00:44:31.377 --> 00:44:35.089
And I beg forgiveness if I,
at all, overstepped at the parley.

00:44:35.173 --> 00:44:36.882
It was your hour, not mine.

00:44:36.966 --> 00:44:38.676
Your aggression weakened the Song.

00:44:39.885 --> 00:44:41.762
Wolf and crow, Ahmad.

00:44:41.846 --> 00:44:43.848
I am just a bookkeeper.

00:44:43.931 --> 00:44:47.142
I tally, I account, I serve.

00:44:47.227 --> 00:44:48.519
It was our day.

00:44:48.603 --> 00:44:50.521
Were we born of the same mother,

00:44:50.605 --> 00:44:53.065
we could not have worked
together better as brothers.

00:45:18.633 --> 00:45:19.925
[Jia Sidao] <i>A piece of linen...</i>

00:45:20.009 --> 00:45:24.805
is wrapped
over the four small toes...

00:45:27.224 --> 00:45:29.894
pulled under the instep

00:45:29.977 --> 00:45:31.812
and behind the heel.

00:45:49.914 --> 00:45:51.624
Come.

00:45:57.046 --> 00:45:58.673
[Jia Sidao] <i>Now, this linen...</i>

00:45:58.756 --> 00:46:02.635
is tightened daily
until the toes break,

00:46:02.718 --> 00:46:05.137
fold under the foot

00:46:05.220 --> 00:46:07.890
and flatten themselves
against the sole.

00:46:19.902 --> 00:46:24.156
The heel becomes slender over time.

00:46:24.239 --> 00:46:26.116
And finally...

00:46:26.200 --> 00:46:29.119
the heel shifts forward
to the ball of the foot,

00:46:29.203 --> 00:46:32.415
breaking the arch
and forcing it upward.

00:46:50.182 --> 00:46:51.434
My Lady.

00:47:01.777 --> 00:47:04.196
The Khan is dissatisfied.

00:47:04.279 --> 00:47:06.991
I am pained
to hear such news.

00:47:07.074 --> 00:47:09.535
As well you should be.

00:47:12.162 --> 00:47:13.247
Show me.

00:47:14.248 --> 00:47:15.583
Empress?

00:47:15.666 --> 00:47:18.085
Show me how you move.

00:47:20.045 --> 00:47:22.715
I will remedy your flaws.

00:47:42.985 --> 00:47:46.155
Do you think you would like to be
one of these hallowed women?

00:47:47.573 --> 00:47:49.492
Like the beautiful dancer Yao Niang?

00:47:49.575 --> 00:47:51.411
Chancellor?

00:47:53.538 --> 00:47:54.705
Yes?

00:48:06.426 --> 00:48:09.429
Your mother should have
started this years ago.

00:48:11.431 --> 00:48:14.141
She causes you this pain.

00:48:16.519 --> 00:48:17.937
[bones cracking]
[screaming]

00:48:19.396 --> 00:48:20.898
Be still, my Sunflower.

00:48:22.942 --> 00:48:24.527
-Be still.
-[screaming continues]

00:48:27.947 --> 00:48:29.114
[horses whinnying]
[men shouting]

00:48:48.258 --> 00:48:49.844
[man]
We are your ambassadors.

00:48:50.595 --> 00:48:53.180
Please! Mercy!
We are Song!

00:48:53.931 --> 00:48:55.099
[groans]

00:48:56.308 --> 00:48:57.643
[speaking Cantonese]

00:49:00.771 --> 00:49:02.147
[Kublai laughing]

00:49:02.231 --> 00:49:03.774
[man laughing]

00:49:24.253 --> 00:49:28.048
I expect that sacrifice was a ruse
the Great Khan had intended.

00:49:28.132 --> 00:49:29.133
Hmm.

00:49:33.929 --> 00:49:35.848
Do you worry for your father?

00:49:40.310 --> 00:49:42.813
My father brought
his plight upon himself.

00:49:44.273 --> 00:49:46.150
I know this.

00:49:46.233 --> 00:49:47.902
It keeps sleep at bay, hmm?

00:49:50.404 --> 00:49:53.574
A persistent affliction
since I was a boy.

00:49:55.075 --> 00:49:57.537
And is it this affliction
that sees you roaming

00:49:57.620 --> 00:50:00.289
at night on horseback?

00:50:01.707 --> 00:50:06.837
The canals called to me at home.
Here, the grasslands.

00:50:08.964 --> 00:50:11.091
[Kublai] It is a demon like no other.

00:50:12.843 --> 00:50:16.180
One who sleeps
wherever he lays his head

00:50:16.263 --> 00:50:18.641
can never understand the beast.

00:50:18.724 --> 00:50:20.810
You, too, My Lord?

00:50:22.937 --> 00:50:27.107
The distractions of rule
occupy my mind when I should sleep.

00:50:27.191 --> 00:50:31.445
You are a thinker, Latin,
as am I.

00:50:33.447 --> 00:50:35.532
This is good.

00:50:55.135 --> 00:50:58.013
Amends must be made
for your father's crime.

00:50:59.514 --> 00:51:00.557
[sighs]

00:51:00.641 --> 00:51:02.602
I understand.

00:51:03.518 --> 00:51:05.395
You will decide his fate.

00:51:07.564 --> 00:51:09.399
My Lord?

00:51:09.483 --> 00:51:11.861
Left to my vice regent, Yusuf,
or myself,

00:51:11.944 --> 00:51:14.154
your father's punishment
would be certain.

00:51:15.280 --> 00:51:17.532
His thief heart would now be still.

00:51:18.743 --> 00:51:21.495
I know the pain
this will cause you.

00:51:21.578 --> 00:51:24.206
I know compassion.

00:51:24.289 --> 00:51:25.625
And you know our laws...

00:51:26.959 --> 00:51:28.794
our customs.

00:51:29.712 --> 00:51:31.672
You will choose
your father's punishment.

00:51:32.798 --> 00:51:36.135
And then you shall find sleep.

00:51:39.972 --> 00:51:42.182
[theme music playing]